WEBVTT

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.323
Ali teško je stajati dugo

00:01:01.323 --> 00:01:03.255
na Severnom polu

00:01:03.255 --> 00:01:05.400
jer se on nalazi nasred okeana

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:08.420
prekrivenog ledom koji se stalno pomera.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.169
Ako biste upali u vodu na Severnom polu,

00:01:11.169 --> 00:01:15.634
upali biste u vodu dubine 4.260 metara.

00:01:15.634 --> 00:01:18.174
Iznad vode, prosečne zimske temperature

00:01:18.174 --> 00:01:21.593
mogu biti do minus 40°C,

00:01:21.593 --> 00:01:23.349
a najniža zabeležena temperatura

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:27.550
je oko minus 68°C.

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:29.263
Uprkos ovim surovim uslovima,

00:01:29.263 --> 00:01:31.575
ljudi su naseljavali oblasti na Arktiku